## About Identify

Identify is about understanding the organisation's assets and risks. Without a current picture of systems, data and dependencies it is impossible to prioritise protective measures.

## Key areas

- Inventory physical and digital assets
- Identify vulnerabilities and threats
- Assess impact and likelihood
- Document data flows and external dependencies
